"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"WO-ofNAvSuJpdRt9Auon6w","review_id":"OU6ZgEufFBLSA9mBa3Jt9Q","date":"2018-05-01T19:05:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9470785856246948,"text_excerpt":"I came here a total of 3 times so far. This place is pretty small with only 2 small tables inside and outside tables along the building. It was raining for my first visit, so there was no outdoor seating. The inside tables were taken, so I decided to just get take out. I was shocked that this place was so small, especially with the good food that they serve. This place is the true representation of a hole-in-the-wall. I had the Superdome and the Dat Fries. The Superdome was pretty good, but the Dat Fries really stood out to me. They used candied bacon bits that went well with the Cajun ranch fries. For my second visit, I was lucky enough to dine inside for lunch. I ordered 10 wings which ..."},{"business_id":"WO-ofNAvSuJpdRt9Auon6w","review_id":"8DtoEYiPlVMoCZ_4n35JeQ","date":"2018-11-12T13:31:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.941863477230072,"text_excerpt":"Delicious, soulful New Orleans style comfort food. The chef here has some chops and executes the food with skill and even restraint. We've had this place bookmarked for some time, and finally decided a pre-movie lunch was in order. We parked on the street and made our way inside to what is essentially the to-go area. Tia, the chef/owner's daughter and our host for the meal, told us we were the first arrivals and met us on the sidewalk to let us into the main dining room. I mention this because this building can be confusing to new comers, and it's easier to just go through the grocery store entrance. The dining space is small and homey. I was very comfortable and we were treated to excell..."},{"business_id":"WO-ofNAvSuJpdRt9Auon6w","review_id":"zALkhfvBnwJ6bLDSZ9M6rQ","date":"2018-06-29T01:03:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9405009746551514,"text_excerpt":"Since me and my girlfriend been here, this restaurant is by far, the BEST restaurant we been to so far. Worth the travel, worth every penny, and you can save more with the Groupon available on the site. It's not too far from downtown but it's a pretty long walk if that's the route you choose. Besides that the food was amazing. The freshness, the quality, the flavor and seasoning was A1. Service was very good too, as they offered us free appetizer plates of upcoming ideas for their menu, which both of them tasted great. Our food was fresh, nice and hot and well prepared. The crawfish fries was my favorite. So many flavors and tastes gahhhdammm this is what I was looking for when it came to..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"WO-ofNAvSuJpdRt9Auon6w","photo_id":"LoJBDRUvBfEfIQ9H4WjMSA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LoJBDRUvBfEfIQ9H4WjMSA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8592939972877502},{"business_id":"WO-ofNAvSuJpdRt9Auon6w","photo_id":"pDDWoGpQrd1LTHEZPFHmZA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/pDDWoGpQrd1LTHEZPFHmZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8135138750076294},{"business_id":"WO-ofNAvSuJpdRt9Auon6w","photo_id":"1wpHn2dUMaMnw-K542Oqfw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1wpHn2dUMaMnw-K